etica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动全面限制员工使用第三方AI工具并封禁L4级代码仓库外部访问</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动Seedance海外收入占比达50%，半年实现近5倍增长</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">国内首个三晋文化大模型“晋问AI”正式上线并发布数字人“晋豆”</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里云发布AI投研工作台Qovest，面向个人用户开启99元/月邀测</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4da393523cccf2c727d3ad660579a987.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里云正式发布面向专业机构投资者的AI投研工作台Qovest，现已在官网开放个人用户邀测，订阅价格分为每月99元与199元两档。该产品基于自研金融场景Agent工程框架Harness，通过接入权威金融数据库，实现从数据调用到深度分析及报告生成的全流程自动化。Qovest支持用户通过自然语言提出需求，系统可自动跟踪研究对象并沉淀投研成果。在FinFirst与IRAB开源金融评测集中，Qovest在回答质量、响应速度及成本控制方面表现领先。产品内置人形机器人产业链拆解、数据中心电力设施投资测算及黄金ETF动态跟踪等案例，支持定时任务与操盘笔记接入。阿里云通过将金融数据、Agent框架与工作流封装为标准化产品，旨在将重复性投研工作交由AI处理，推动AI在专业投研领域的落地从模型能力竞争转向行业数据与流程能力的深度整合</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果推送 iOS 27.3 测试版，国行 Apple 智能接入阿里千问</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/12fafa8f5a2c372d886bb2db209a533e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果今日推送 iOS 27.3 首个开发者测试版，正式向国行用户开放首批 Apple 智能功能。此次更新核心在于本地化部署，Siri、视觉智能及写作工具全面整合阿里千问大模型，支持系统内问答、文本生成与图像处理。视觉智能的以图搜物功能同步接入百度搜索。用户通过 Siri 询问基础问题时可直接调用千问，若需个性化方案，系统支持跳转至千问 App 并自动同步对话信息。此外，实时翻译功能已覆盖信息、电话及 FaceTime。首批功能支持 iPhone 15 Pro 系列、iPhone 16 全系列及后续机型，要求设备与 Siri 语言设置为简体中文或英语。此次更新标志着苹果 AI 在中国市场的落地进程加速，但 WWDC 2026 预告的新版 Siri AI 尚未包含在本次测试中。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动全面限制员工使用第三方AI工具并封禁L4级代码仓库外部访问</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d8a99773646ec407ef9c7515421df4da.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动自本月起全面收紧外部AI工具使用权限，对全公司L4级代码仓库及飞书文档实施外部AI访问封禁，员工自费购买的Claude、Codex等个人账号将无法在内部网络使用。此次风控升级旨在防范数据泄露与资产安全风险，技术副总裁洪定坤表示，L3及以上级别核心内容泄露后果严重。此前，字节跳动已于2025年6月起分批禁用Cursor、Windsurf等第三方AI编程工具，全面转向旗下编程助手Trae。这一举措反映出公司在加速推进自研大模型生态的同时，正对核心技术资产保护采取严苛管控。创始人张一鸣此前明确表态不依赖AI蒸馏技术改进模型，显示出公司在技术路线与数据合规上的战略收紧。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动Seedance海外收入占比达50%，半年实现近5倍增长</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8cb4e67f91eb28ea66ed5002db0c70ff.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动旗下视频生成模型Seedance海外收入占比已达50%，过去半年在海外市场实现近5倍增长。该增长主要得益于版权合规的突破，字节跳动于今年8月与美国电影协会（MPA）签署全球谅解备忘录，并促成迪士尼与TikTok的内容合作。在产品层面，Seedance 2.0深度嵌入TikTok、剪映海外版及即梦海外版，依托流量优势降低获客成本。目前，Seedance客户结构发生显著变化，实体产业客户占比已超四分之一，覆盖制造、汽车等行业，火山引擎通过前沿部署工程师团队推动模型深入生产环境。在国内市场，腾讯与B站位列其核心客户前列。Seedance的进展标志着头部AI视频模型正从C端娱乐流量争夺，向深入千行百业的生产基础设施演进，与快手可灵等竞品共同加速全球化布局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">国内首个三晋文化大模型“晋问AI”正式上线并发布数字人“晋豆”</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5b0c902b021224608de2c2869cb62ca8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">2026年11月3日，国内首个聚焦山西地域文化的垂类大模型“晋问AI”正式上线，专属数字人“晋豆”同步亮相。该项目由山西省委宣传部指导、山西出版传媒集团承建，已纳入山西省“十五五”规划。技术架构采用“LLM+RAG+Agent”方案，集成腾讯混元、DeepSeek等主流模型，依托出版集团权威图书内容构建知识库。项目通过严苛技术保障，实现知识调用准确率99%，幻觉率控制在1%以内，响应延迟低于200毫秒。系统构建了“知三晋、识古建、会晋商、寻根脉、绘文创、访名士、忆烽火”七大文化智能体，赋能文旅与特色产业。目前，“AI+AR智能眼镜”导游应用已在晋商博物院落地。用户可通过官方网站及小程序体验，该模型旨在通过数字化手段推动山西历史文化传承与产业创新。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
